slash David Pakman show.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:42.120
Let me know on Twitter at d pacman or at David
Pakman show number one.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:44.750
How do Ben and Ferran due next week?

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:50.709
And number two, who else would you like to
see guest hosting the David Pakman show?

00:02:50.709 --> 00:02:55.299
And they've got to be more or less in line
with my politics, I think to be good fits

00:02:55.299 --> 00:02:56.400
for the show.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.049
Um, let me know.

00:02:58.049 --> 00:02:59.659
We still got all of today.

00:02:59.659 --> 00:03:00.670
We will take phone calls.

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:01.879
I will answer audience questions.

00:03:01.879 --> 00:03:05.299
We've got a great bonus show coming up, but
next week the show is not been canceled and

00:03:05.299 --> 00:03:07.030
I have not been kicked off of the show.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.709
I'm just going to be off for four days and
